0:16.610">huh</span><span begin="00:16.610" end="00:16.940">, </span><span begin="00:16.940" end="00:17.240">no </span><span begin="00:17.240" end="00:17.540">don't </span><span begin="00:17.540" end="00:18.560">hide</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.740" end="00:21.740"><span begin="00:18.740" end="00:19.010">Been </span><span begin="00:19.010" end="00:19.460">running </span><span begin="00:19.460" end="00:19.820">from </span><span begin="00:19.820" end="00:19.940">it </span><span begin="00:19.940" end="00:20.240">for </span><span begin="00:20.240" end="00:20.390">the </span><span begin="00:20.390" end="00:20.930">longest </span><span begin="00:20.930" end="00:21.740">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.100" end="00:25.520"><span begin="00:22.100" end="00:22.610">So </span><span begin="00:22.610" end="00:23.150">many </span><span begin="00:23.150" end="00:23.990">mornings </span><span begin="00:23.990" end="00:24.140">I </span><span begin="00:24.140" end="00:24.560">woke </span><span begin="00:24.560" end="00:24.740">up </span><span begin="00:24.740" end="00:25.520">confused</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.520" end="00:29.060"><span begin="00:25.520" end="00:25.700">In </span><span begin="00:25.700" end="00:25.970">my </span><span begin="00:25.970" end="00:26.480">dreams</span><span begin="00:26.480" end="00:26.480">, </span><span begin="00:26.480" end="00:26.660">I </span><span begin="00:26.660" end="00:26.960">do </span><span begin="00:26.960" end="00:27.920">anything </span><span begin="00:27.920" end="00:28.130">I </span><span begin="00:28.130" end="00:28.490">want </span><span begin="00:28.490" end="00:28.700">to </span><span begin="00:28.700" end="00:29.060">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.060" end="00:37.370"><span begin="00:29.060" end="00:29.420">My </span><span begin="00:29.420" end="00:30.410">emotions </span><span begin="00:30.410" end="00:30.560">are </span><span begin="00:30.560" end="00:31.220">naked</span><span begin="00:31.220" end="00:31.220">, </span><span begin="00:31.220" end="00:31.460">they're </span><span begin="00:31.460" end="00:32.150">taking </span><span begin="00:32.150" end="00:32.480">me </span><span begin="00:32.480" end="00:32.870">out </span><span begin="00:32.870" end="00:32.990">of </span><span begin="00:32.990" end="00:33.680">my </span><span begin="00:33.680" end="00:37.370">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.430" end="00:40.880"><span begin="00:37.430" end="00:37.940">Right </span><span begin="00:37.940" end="00:38.390">now </span><span begin="00:38.390" end="00:38.780">I'm </span><span begin="00:38.780" end="00:40.880">shameless</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.000" end="00:44.570"><span begin="00:41.000" end="00:42.110">Screaming </span><span begin="00:42.110" end="00:42.500">my </span><span begin="00:42.500" end="00:43.190">lungs </span><span begin="00:43.190" end="00:43.490">out </span><span begin="00:43.490" end="00:43.970">for </span><span begin="00:43.970" end="00:44.570">ya</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.780" end="00:48.290"><span begin="00:44.780" end="00:45.200">Not </span><span begin="00:45.200" end="00:45.890">afraid </span><span begin="00:45.890" end="00:46.130">to </span><span begin="00:46.130" end="00:47.060">face </span><span begin="00:47.060" end="00:48.290">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.350" end="00:50.180"><span begin="00:48.350" end="00:48.500">I </span><span begin="00:48.500" end="00:48.920">need </span><span begin="00:48.920" end="00:49.040">you </span><span begin="00:49.040" end="00:49.250">more </span><span begin="00:49.250" end="00:49.400">than </span><span begin="00:49.400" end="00:49.460">I </span><span begin="00:49.460" end="00:49.850">want </span><span begin="00:49.850" end="00:50.180">to</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.420" end="00:52.010"><span begin="00:50.420" end="00:50.810">Need </span><span begin="00:50.810" end="00:50.900">you </span><span begin="00:50.900" end=