 begin="01:32.600" end="01:32.780">and </span><span begin="01:32.780" end="01:32.930">I'm </span><span begin="01:32.930" end="01:33.320">tired </span><span begin="01:33.320" end="01:33.410">of </span><span begin="01:33.410" end="01:33.680">having </span><span begin="01:33.680" end="01:34.220">somebody </span><span begin="01:34.220" end="01:34.370">that's </span><span begin="01:34.370" end="01:34.550">not </span><span begin="01:34.550" end="01:35.390">mine</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.020" end="01:39.380"><span begin="01:36.020" end="01:36.470">So </span><span begin="01:36.470" end="01:37.010">many </span><span begin="01:37.010" end="01:37.820">mornings </span><span begin="01:37.820" end="01:37.970">I </span><span begin="01:37.970" end="01:38.390">woke </span><span begin="01:38.390" end="01:38.600">up </span><span begin="01:38.600" end="01:39.380">confused</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.380" end="01:42.890"><span begin="01:39.380" end="01:39.560">In </span><span begin="01:39.560" end="01:39.830">my </span><span begin="01:39.830" end="01:40.310">dreams</span><span begin="01:40.310" end="01:40.310">, </span><span begin="01:40.310" end="01:40.490">I </span><span begin="01:40.490" end="01:40.820">do </span><span begin="01:40.820" end="01:41.780">anything </span><span begin="01:41.780" end="01:41.990">I </span><span begin="01:41.990" end="01:42.350">want </span><span begin="01:42.350" end="01:42.530">to </span><span begin="01:42.530" end="01:42.890">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.890" end="01:51.260"><span begin="01:42.890" end="01:43.250">My </span><span begin="01:43.250" end="01:44.240">emotions </span><span begin="01:44.240" end="01:44.390">are </span><span begin="01:44.390" end="01:45.080">naked</span><span begin="01:45.080" end="01:45.080">, </span><span begin="01:45.080" end="01:45.290">they're </span><span begin="01:45.290" end="01:46.010">taking </span><span begin="01:46.010" end="01:46.310">me </span><span begin="01:46.310" end